'''Kerihime''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] implemented in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]] and would be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. As of [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]], she was given a [[True Form]] which improves her attack power and movement speed.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 26
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kerihime
|name2 = Full color Kerihime
|name3 = Bridal Princess Punt
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Full color Kerihime''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Bridal Princess Punt''' when obtained from the [[Princess Punt Awakens!]] (may drop on the 1st stage but guaranteed on the 2nd) and is at level 20.

==Strategy/Usage==
Despite being a free unit with a relatively easy awakening stage, she faces rough competition once rushers like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev]] are obtained. Even with her True Form, she cannot reach even half the HP, damage or speed of Bullet Train, let alone lacking the [[Money Up]] ability entirely. This means that she struggles with bringing anything meaningful to the battlefield. Her one solace is being allowed in 4-crown restriction stages. However, she virtually requires boosting with Catseyes, and even then, she once again loses her use once [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] is obtained.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher}}

