==Trivia==
*According to the [[Nyanko Daisensou 4Koma & Strategy App|Nyanko Daisensou 4koma]], she had a child with [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], making [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Cat]].
*Kerihime is not only the very first collaboration unit, but also the very first unit added after [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].
*Kerihime and [[Cat Princess (Special Cat)|Cat Princess]] share the record for taking the longest amount of time for a unit to be ported over from BCJP to BCEN, taking an astounding 10 years.
**Despite this, the names and descriptions for both units, excluding Kerihime's True Form, have existed in the game files ever since their addition, never being re-written in that time (which is why their descriptions resemble those of the original [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|Battle Cats]]).
***This is why she's still referred to as "Kerihime" in her first and second form, despite every other part of the game calling her Princess Punt.

